2:T416,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How PlanBot's AI Actually Works: Under the Hood","description":"Ever wondered how PlanBot generates the perfect schedule? A behind-the-scenes look at the AI technology powering your daily productivity.","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Intent Parsing","text":"The NLP engine breaks down your prompt into core objectives, time constraints, and contextual nuances."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Persona Matching","text":"The AI cross-references your prompt against predefined cognitive models (e.g. Student, Professional) to select the right methodology."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"AI Engine Routing","text":"Your request is dynamically routed to the appropriate AI engine tier (Basic, Standard, Advanced, or Premium) based on your subscription."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Gamification Layer Integration","text":"The system assigns XP values to generated tasks based on cognitive load before presenting the final schedule."}]}a:["slug","how-planbot-ai-works","d"]
